Changes of the ClusterConfiguration,
e.g. via :ref:`configuration-options.yk8s.kubernetes.apiserver.audit_logs.enabled`
or :ref:`configuration-options.yk8s.kubernetes.kubeadm.extraClusterConfiguration`,
are now applied to existing clusters.
The ``kubeadm-config`` ConfigMap is updated and the control plane nodes are reconfigured one after another
with ``kubeadm upgrade node phase control-plane``.
Changes of the etcd settings are still only applied on Kubernetes upgrades.
Manual changes of the ``kubeadm-config`` ConfigMap are overwritten.
